{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfZ3uifhPLYod89r9J8wN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0199VGLdszoStTzNroEZF9Kk","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /workspace; uv run python - <<'EOF'\nimport re\ns=open('agent/modeling.py').read()\nold=s[s.index('    # future minutes'):s.index('    sd = np.sqrt(v_steps)')]\nnew='''    # future minutes covered by the scored path: the realized path's point j is the close of the\n    # bar labelled t0 + j*step, i.e. the price at t0 + j*step + 1min. Scored changes are relative\n    # to point 0, so the minutes between the last context close and t0 are not simulated.\n    t0 = pd.Timestamp(start_time)\n    if t0.tzinfo is None:\n        t0 = t0.tz_localize(\"UTC\")\n    n_min = time_length // 60\n    fut = t0 + pd.to_timedelta(np.arange(1, n_min + 1), unit=\"min\")\n    s_fut = _minute_profile(prof, fut)\n    h = np.arange(1, n_min + 1, dtype=float) + 3.0\n    dec = np.exp(-h / p[\"tau_short\"])\n    L = L_long + (w_s * (L_s - L_long) + w_m * (L_m - L_long)) * dec\n    L = np.maximum(L, 0.05 * L_long)\n    v = p[\"scale\"] * L * s_fut  # per-minute variance\n\n    k = time_increment // 60\n    v_steps = v.reshape(steps, k).sum(1)\n'''\ns=s.replace(old,new)\ns=s.replace(\"return (start_time, time_increment, *paths)\",\"return (start_time, time_increment, *paths.tolist())\")\nopen('agent/modeling.py','w').write(s)\nEOF\ngrep -v Warn cache/fetch.log | cut -c1-200; ls cache/field"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2259,"cache_read_input_tokens":103497,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2259,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2d6fedfa-14d9-4a81-8f98-858ec201a373","uuid":"