{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012rK7tjjbeikZXtWqcKnDpm","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"BLS 2026 release schedule CPI September 2026 date\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"CPI Home : U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics\",\"url\":\"https://www.bls.gov/cpi/\"},{\"title\":\"Schedule of Selected Releases for September 2026\",\"url\":\"https://www.bls.gov/schedule/\"},{\"title\":\"Schedule of Releases for the Consumer Price Index\",\"url\":\"https://www.bls.gov/schedule/news_release/cpi.htm\"},{\"title\":\"Consumer Price Index News Release - 2026 M08 Results\",\"url\":\"https://www.bls.gov/news.release/cpi.htm\"},{\"title\":\"Consumer Price Index\",\"url\":\"https://www.usinflationcalculator.com/inflation/consumer-price-index-release-schedule/\"},{\"title\":\"Consumer Price Index Summary - 2026 M08 Results\",\"url\":\"https://www.bls.gov/news.release/cpi.nr0.htm\"},{\"title\":\"CPI Release Date: Sep 11\",\"url\":\"https://fedratecalc.com/cpi-release-date/\"},{\"title\":\"US Economic Calendar Schedule\",\"url\":\"https://www.calendarx.com/schedule/economic-calendar\"},{\"title\":\"Next CPI Release: Fri, Sep 11, 2026, 8:30am ET\",\"url\":\"https://www.regardsofwallstreet.com/cpi-release-date\"},{\"title\":\"2026 U.S. Economic Calendar: CPI, Jobs, PCE & Fed Dates\",\"url\":\"https://fedratecalc.com/us-economic-calendar/\"}]\n\nThe September 2026 CPI report comes out on **Wednesday, October 14, 2026, at 8:30 a.m. ET**. The BLS CPI page says the Consumer Price Index for September 2026 is scheduled for release on October 14, 2026, at 8:30 A.M. Eastern Time.\n\n**The CPI released during September 2026 (August data):** That report came out on Friday, September 11, 2026, at 8:30 a.m. ET. Results:\n- CPI-U rose 0.4% (seasonally adjusted) in August, after rising 0.1% in July.\n- Over the past 12 months, the all-items index rose 3.4% before seasonal adjustment.\n- Core CPI (all items less food and energy) rose 2.4% over the year, down from 2.5% for the 12 months ending July.\n- Gasoline rose 3.9% in August and made up more than a third of the monthly increase.\n\n**The rest of the 2026 CPI schedule**, from the BLS release page: July 2026 data on Aug. 12; August 2026 on Sep. 11; September 2026 on Oct. 14; October 2026 on Nov. 10; November 2026 on Dec. 10, all at 8:30 a.m. ET.\n\n**Related releases for September data:** The September Employment Situation (jobs report) comes out Fri, Oct 2, 2026, and the September Producer Price Index (PPI) on Thu, Oct 15, 2026, both at 8:30 AM ET.\n\nFor the official schedule, see bls.gov/schedule/news_release/cpi.htm.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2d6fedfa-14d9-4a81-8f98-858ec201a373","uuid":"c7653426-05ca-4c98-a866-c3f2542f852f","timestamp":"2026-09-30T06:30:11.961Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"BLS 2026 release schedule CPI September 2026 date","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_011PfGYDTTSiaHgWfNqxYa8A","content":[{"title":"CPI Home : U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics","url":"https://www.bls.gov/cpi/"},{"title":"Schedule of Selected Releases for September 2026","url":"https://www.bls.gov/schedule/"},{"title":"Schedule of Releases for the Consumer Price Index","url":"https://www.bls.gov/schedule/news_release/cpi.htm"},{"title":"Consumer Price Index News Release - 2026 M08 Results","url":"https://www.bls.gov/news.release/cpi.htm"},{"title":"Consumer Price Index","url":"https://www.usinflationcalculator.com/inflation/consumer-price-index-release-schedule/"},{"title":"Consumer Price Index Summary - 2026 M08 Results","url":"https://www.bls.gov/news.release/cpi.nr0.htm"},{"title":"CPI Release Date: Sep 11","url":"https://fedratecalc.com/cpi-release-date/"},{"title":"US Economic Calendar Schedule","url":"https://www.calendarx.com/schedule/economic-calendar"},{"title":"Next CPI Release: Fri, Sep 11, 2026, 8:30am ET","url":"https://www.reg